# ripgrep's ignore file for this repository. Applies to every rg run that keeps
# ripgrep's default ignore handling (rg itself, and tools built on it).
#
# CGGA is the held-out external cohort. See .clineignore for why it is here, and
# docs/reproducibility.md ("Workspace-wide tools"). The limit of this file: rg
# --no-ignore and rg -uu skip it. That is why .clinerules also forbids
# workspace-wide searches in this repository.
#
# Keep these two lines in step with .clineignore.
data/raw/cgga/
data/processed/cgga/
